  15:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *           + RTC Tamper and TimeStamp Pins Selection
  16:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *           + Interrupts and flags management
