 191:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c **** /** @addtogroup RTC_Exported_Functions_Group1
 192:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *  @brief    Initialization and Configuration functions
 193:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *
 194:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c **** @verbatim
 195:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 196:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****               ##### Initialization and de-initialization functions #####
 197:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 198:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****    [..] This section provides functions allowing to initialize and configure the
 199:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****          RTC Prescaler (Synchronous and Asynchronous), RTC Hour format, disable
 200:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****          RTC registers Write protection, enter and exit the RTC initialization mode,
ARM GAS  C:\Users\843E~1\AppData\Local\Temp\ccZjV6EC.s 			page 5


 201:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****          RTC registers synchronization check and reference clock detection enable.
 202:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****          (#) The RTC Prescaler is programmed to generate the RTC 1Hz time base.
 203:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              It is split into 2 programmable prescalers to minimize power consumption.
 204:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              (++) A 7-bit asynchronous prescaler and a 15-bit synchronous prescaler.
 205:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              (++) When both prescalers are used, it is recommended to configure the
 206:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****                  asynchronous prescaler to a high value to minimize power consumption.
 207:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****          (#) All RTC registers are Write protected. Writing to the RTC registers
 208:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              is enabled by writing a key into the Write Protection register, RTC_WPR.
 209:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****          (#) To configure the RTC Calendar, user application should enter
 210:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              initialization mode. In this mode, the calendar counter is stopped
 211:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              and its value can be updated. When the initialization sequence is
 212:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              complete, the calendar restarts counting after 4 RTCCLK cycles.
 213:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****          (#) To read the calendar through the shadow registers after Calendar
 214:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              initialization, calendar update or after wakeup from low power modes
 215:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              the software must first clear the RSF flag. The software must then
 216:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              wait until it is set again before reading the calendar, which means
 217:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              that the calendar registers have been correctly copied into the
 218:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              RTC_TR and RTC_DR shadow registers.The HAL_RTC_WaitForSynchro() function
 219:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****              implements the above software sequence (RSF clear and RSF check).
 220:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c **** 
 221:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c **** @endverbatim
