 883:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *                with input format (BIN or BCD), also SubSeconds field returning the
 884:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *                RTC_SSR register content and SecondFraction field the Synchronous pre-scaler
 885:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *                factor to be used for second fraction ratio computation.
 886:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   * @param Format Specifies the format of the entered parameters.
 887:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 888:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *            @arg RTC_FORMAT_BIN: Binary data format
 889:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *            @arg RTC_FORMAT_BCD: BCD data format
 890:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   * @note  You can use SubSeconds and SecondFraction (sTime structure fields returned) to convert S
 891:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *        value in second fraction ratio with time unit following generic formula:
 892:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *        Second fraction ratio * time_unit= [(SecondFraction-SubSeconds)/(SecondFraction+1)] * ti
 893:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *        This conversion can be performed only if no shift operation is pending (ie. SHFP=0) when
 894:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   * @note  You must call HAL_RTC_GetDate() after HAL_RTC_GetTime() to unlock the values
 895:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *        in the higher-order calendar shadow registers to ensure consistency between the time and
 896:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *        Reading RTC current time locks the values in calendar shadow registers until Current dat
 897:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   *        to ensure consistency between the time and date values.
 898:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc.c ****   * @retval HAL status
